---
import "../styles/style.css";

import examples from "../images/patrick-perkins-ETRPjvb0KM0-unsplash.jpg";
import Navigation from "../components/Navigation.astro";
import Head from "../components/Head.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

import bullet from "../images/bullet.png";
---

<html lang="en-GB">
  <Head />
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

    <Navigation link="whatwedo" />

    <main id="main" class="main-content">
      <Hero image={examples} alt="A borad of post-it notes">
        <p>
          At CECAN Ltd, we work across a range of policy areas, helping
          organisations understand complexity and make evidence-informed
          decisions through innovative evaluation methods. Our work bridges
          research and practice, ensuring evidence is translated into actionable
          insights that support better decision-making.
        </p>
      </Hero>
      <section>
        <div class="grid-cols-1">
          <div class="info-card">
            <h1>Our Services</h1>

            <h2>Consultancy</h2>
            <p>
              Working alongside government departments, public bodies and
              research organisations, we provide independent advice,
              facilitation and evaluation across a wide range of policy areas.
            </p>
            <ul class="bullet-list" style={`--bullet: url(${bullet.src})`}>
              <li>
                <h3>Complexity-informed Evaluation</h3>
                <p>
                  We design and deliver evaluations that recognise the
                  interconnected nature of today’s policy challenges, helping
                  organisations understand not only whether something works, but
                  how and why outcomes emerge.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <h3>Systems Thinking</h3>
                <p>
                  Our systems-based approaches help identify relationships,
                  feedback loops and wider influences that shape policy and
                  programme outcomes.
                </p>
                <p>
                  We have a particular expertise in Participatory Systems
                  Mapping and related systems thinking approaches but can offer
                  the full range of methods and approaches outlined in the
                  CECAN-authored <i>Handling Complexity in Policy Evaluation</i> (a
                  supplementary guide to the <i>Magenta Book</i>, the
                  government’s guide to policy evaluation).
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <h3>Policy Appraisal</h3>
                <p>
                  We support organisations in designing, reviewing and improving
                  policies through robust analytical approaches and practical
                  recommendations.
                </p>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Training and Capacity Building</h2>
            <p>
              We offer bespoke training and coaching to help organisations
              develop systems thinking and complexity-informed evaluation skills
              in practice.
            </p>

            <ul class="bullet-list" style={`--bullet: url(${bullet.src})`}>
              <li>
                <h3>Bespoke training courses</h3><p>
                  We design and deliver bespoke training for organisations,
                  targeting their individual needs in mode of delivery and
                  content. We provide an effective route for training staff that
                  can be carried out at your location or online. Delivering
                  training at your location reduces delegates’ travel time and
                  cost, while using an online platform offers a flexible
                  approach if delegates are geographically dispersed. With an
                  audience of similar needs we can tailor the course to their
                  specific field or problem, ensuring the training is translated
                  into practice with ease. Please <a
                    href="mailto:training@cecan.co.uk">get in touch</a
                  > if you would like further details.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <h3>Bespoke Coaching</h3><p>
                  In addition to our training offer, our evaluation experts are
                  able to offer bespoke coaching sessions for smaller groups: we
                  usually recommend about five people. The sessions can form
                  part of a bigger bespoke training package, or run as a
                  stand-alone series if preferred. They provide an opportunity
                  for participants to work very closely with one or two of our
                  carefully matched evaluation experts in a very focussed and
                  practical way. Sessions are delivered online at times that are
                  convenient to you, subject to our coaches’ availability.
                  Please <a href="mailto:training@cecan.co.uk">get in touch</a> if
                  you would like further details.
                </p>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <Footer />
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
